{
  "lessonId": "L2M3L4",
  "title": "Calabria 卡拉布里亞",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16a085 0%,#1abc9c 100%)'><h1>🌊 Calabria</h1><p class='subtitle'>義大利「腳尖」的古老品種寶庫</p></section><section class='slide' style='background:#f8f9fa'><h2 style='color:#16a085;border-bottom:3px solid #1abc9c;padding-bottom:12px;margin-bottom:30px'>🏺 Calabria葡萄酒歷史深度演變：從Oenotria到現代復興</h2><div style='background:#fff;padding:35px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.12)'><div style='margin-bottom:35px'><h3 style='color:#16a085;margin:0 0 25px;font-size:1.4rem;text-align:center'>📜 2800年歷史時間軸</h3><div style='position:relative;padding:20px 0'><div style='position:absolute;left:50%;top:0;bottom:0;width:3px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#d4af37,#16a085,#3498db,#1abc9c);transform:translateX(-50%)'></div><div style='display:grid;gap:25px'><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;gap:20px;align-items:center'><div style='text-align:right;padding-right:20px'><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d4af37,#f39c12);color:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(212,175,55,.3)'><h4 style='margin:0 0 10px;font-size:1.15rem'>🏛️ 古希臘黃金時代</h4><p style='margin:0;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.7'><strong style='font-size:1.1rem'>BC 800 - AD 500</strong><br>• Magna Graecia文明中心<br>• 「Oenotria」(葡萄酒之地)美譽<br>• Cremissa傳奇葡萄酒供應奧運<br>• Sybaris奢華文明象徵<br>• 最早Gaglioppo種植記錄</p></div></div><div style='width:30px;height:30px;background:#d4af37;border:4px solid #fff;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #d4af37;z-index:1;position:relative'></div><div></div></div><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;gap:20px;align-items:center'><div></div><div style='width:30px;height:30px;background:#c0392b;border:4px solid #fff;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #c0392b;z-index:1;position:relative'></div><div style='text-align:left;padding-left:20px'><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c0392b,#e74c3c);color:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(192,57,43,.3)'><h4 style='margin:0 0 10px;font-size:1.15rem'>📉 貧困與移民時代</h4><p style='margin:0;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.7'><strong style='font-size:1.1rem'>1950 - 1990</strong><br>• <strong style='color:#fff59d'>50%人口外流</strong>至北部/海外<br>• <strong style='color:#fff59d'>90%散裝酒</strong>低價銷售<br>• 葡萄園面積減少60%<br>• 產業技術落後40年<br>• 「貧困象徵」負面形象</p></div></div></div><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;gap:20px;align-items:center'><div style='text-align:right;padding-right:20px'><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16a085,#1abc9c);color:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(22,160,133,.3)'><h4 style='margin:0 0 10px;font-size:1.15rem'>🌱 現代復興三階段</h4><p style='margin:0;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.7'><strong style='font-size:1.1rem'>1990 - 2025</strong><br><strong style='color:#d4af37'>階段1 (1990-2005):</strong> Librandi先驅<br>Gravello國際混釀成功案例<br><strong style='color:#d4af37'>階段2 (2006-2015):</strong> 自然派崛起<br>A Vita/Ceraudo有機生物動力法<br><strong style='color:#d4af37'>階段3 (2016-2025):</strong> Gaglioppo重新發現<br>單一品種純釀、老藤復興</p></div></div><div style='width:30px;height:30px;background:#1abc9c;border:4px solid #fff;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #1abc9c;z-index:1;position:relative'></div><div></div></div></div></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:35px'><h3 style='color:#16a085;margin:0 0 20px;font-size:1.3rem;text-align:center'>📊 1980 vs 2025 對比：驚人轉型</h3><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:25px'><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#95a5a6,#7f8c8d);color:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 6px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.2)'><div style='font-size:3rem;margin-bottom:10px'>📉</div><h4 style='margin:0 0 20px;font-size:1.4rem;border-bottom:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);padding-bottom:10px'>1980 黑暗時代</h4><div style='text-align:left;line-height:2'><p style='margin:8px 0;font-size:1.05rem'>🍷 <strong>25,000公頃</strong> 葡萄園</p><p style='margin:8px 0;font-size:1.05rem'>📦 <strong>90%散裝酒</strong> 低價銷售</p><p style='margin:8px 0;font-size:1.05rem'>🏛️ <strong>0個DOC認證</strong></p><p style='margin:8px 0;font-size:1.05rem'>💶 <strong>€5M</strong> 年產值</p><p style='margin:8px 0;font-size:1.05rem'>🌍 <strong>出口&lt;2%</strong></p><p style='margin:8px 0;font-size:1.05rem'>👥 <strong>人口減50%</strong></p></div></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16a085,#1abc9c);color:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 6px 15px rgba(22,160,133,.4)'><div style='font-size:3rem;margin-bottom:10px'>📈</div><h4 style='margin:0 0 20px;font-size:1.4rem;border-bottom:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);padding-bottom:10px'>2025 現代復興</h4><div style='text-align:left;line-height:2'><p style='margin:8px 0;font-size:1.05rem'>🍷 <strong>11,000公頃</strong> 精品園(-56%但質量↑)</p><p style='margin:8px 0;font-size:1.05rem'>🍾 <strong>65%瓶裝酒</strong> 品牌化</p><p style='margin:8px 0;font-size:1.05rem'>🏆 <strong>12個DOC認證</strong></p><p style='margin:8px 0;font-size:1.05rem'>💶 <strong>€38M</strong> 年產值(+660%)</p><p style='margin:8px 0;font-size:1.05rem'>🌍 <strong>出口18%</strong> <span style='color:#d4af37;font-weight:700'>(+320%增長)</span></p><p style='margin:8px 0;font-size:1.05rem'>🌱 <strong>35%有機認證</strong> 全義最高</p></div></div></div></div><div><h3 style='color:#16a085;margin:0 0 20px;font-size:1.3rem;text-align:center'>📈 2010-2025 關鍵指標增長曲線</h3><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px'><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8f8f5,#d1f2eb);padding:25px;border-radius:10px;border-left:5px solid #16a085;text-align:center'><div style='font-size:2.5rem;color:#16a085;margin-bottom:8px'>+320%</div><div style='font-size:1.05rem;color:#2c3e50;font-weight:600'>出口增長</div><div style='font-size:.85rem;color:#7f8c8d;margin-top:5px'>2010: €2.8M → 2025: €11.7M</div></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fef9e7,#fcf3cf);padding:25px;border-radius:10px;border-left:5px solid #f39c12;text-align:center'><div style='font-size:2.5rem;color:#f39c12;margin-bottom:8px'>+185%</div><div style='font-size:1.05rem;color:#2c3e50;font-weight:600'>瓶裝酒比例</div><div style='font-size:.85rem;color:#7f8c8d;margin-top:5px'>2010: 28% → 2025: 65%</div></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ebf5fb,#d6eaf8);padding:25px;border-radius:10px;border-left:5px solid #3498db;text-align:center'><div style='font-size:2.5rem;color:#3498db;margin-bottom:8px'>+420%</div><div style='font-size:1.05rem;color:#2c3e50;font-weight:600'>有機認證面積</div><div style='font-size:.85rem;color:#7f8c8d;margin-top:5px'>2010: 750ha → 2025: 3,900ha</div></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fadbd8,#f5b7b1);padding:25px;border-radius:10px;border-left:5px solid #c0392b;text-align:center'><div style='font-size:2.5rem;color:#c0392b;margin-bottom:8px'>+275%</div><div style='font-size:1.05rem;color:#2c3e50;font-weight:600'>單瓶均價</div><div style='font-size:.85rem;color:#7f8c8d;margin-top:5px'>2010: €5.2 → 2025: €19.5</div></div></div></div><div style='margin-top:25px;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d5f4e6,#a3e4d7);border-radius:10px;border-left:5px solid #27ae60'><p style='margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50'><strong style='color:#16a085;font-size:1.2rem'>💡 文化轉型關鍵：</strong>從「貧困象徵」到「古老品種寶庫」— Calabria成功重塑品牌形象，Gaglioppo從「廉價散裝酒」躍升為「南義Pinot Noir」，老藤葡萄園(80-120年)成為稀缺資產，自然派酒莊引領全義有機運動。</p></div></div></section><section class='slide' style='background:#f8f9fa'><h2 style='color:#16a085;border-bottom:3px solid #1abc9c;padding-bottom:12px;margin-bottom:30px'>🍇 Gaglioppo品種科學：「南義Pinot Noir」的10維度對比</h2><div style='background:#fff;padding:35px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.12)'><div style='margin-bottom:30px'><h3 style='color:#16a085;margin:0 0 20px;font-size:1.3rem;text-align:center'>🧬 DNA與起源：古希臘的遠古遺產</h3><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px'><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8f8f5,#d1f2eb);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;border-top:4px solid #16a085'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#16a085;font-size:1.05rem'>📜 歷史起源</h4><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.7;color:#2c3e50'><strong>BC 800引入</strong><br>古希臘殖民者從Peloponnese帶入<br><br><strong>名稱演變：</strong><br>Kalòn Ippos(美麗的馬) → Gaglioppo</p></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fef9e7,#fcf3cf);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;border-top:4px solid #f39c12'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#f39c12;font-size:1.05rem'>🧬 DNA關係</h4><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.7;color:#2c3e50'><strong>遠親：</strong>Sangiovese<br>(共享25%基因)<br><br><strong>無關：</strong>Pinot Noir<br>(相似風格但不同起源)<br><br><strong>克隆數：</strong>23個官方認證</p></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ebf5fb,#d6eaf8);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;border-top:4px solid #3498db'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#3498db;font-size:1.05rem'>🌍 全球分佈</h4><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.7;color:#2c3e50'><strong>Calabria：</strong>8,500ha(98%)<br><strong>Campania：</strong>120ha<br><strong>Sicilia：</strong>80ha<br><strong>其他國家：</strong>&lt;15ha<br><br><strong style='color:#c0392b'>極度地域限定品種</strong></p></div></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:30px'><h3 style='color:#16a085;margin:0 0 20px;font-size:1.3rem;text-align:center'>🔬 Gaglioppo vs Pinot Noir vs Nebbiolo — 超級對比表</h3><div style='overflow-x:auto'><table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.95rem;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.1)'><thead><tr style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16a085,#1abc9c);color:#fff'><th style='padding:15px;text-align:left;font-size:1.05rem;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)'>對比維度</th><th style='padding:15px;text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)'>🍇 Gaglioppo<br><span style='font-size:.85rem;font-weight:400'>(Calabria)</span></th><th style='padding:15px;text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)'>🍷 Pinot Noir<br><span style='font-size:.85rem;font-weight:400'>(Burgundy)</span></th><th style='padding:15px;text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)'>🌹 Nebbiolo<br><span style='font-size:.85rem;font-weight:400'>(Piemonte)</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style='background:#fff'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>1️⃣ 顏色深度</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#e74c3c'>淡</strong><br>2800-4200 mg/L<br>花青素</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#e74c3c'>極淡</strong><br>2200-3800 mg/L<br>花青素</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#e74c3c'>淡</strong><br>2500-4000 mg/L<br>花青素</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8f9fa'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>2️⃣ 單寧結構</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#27ae60'>中等柔順</strong><br>2500-3800 mg/L<br>酚類化合物</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#f39c12'>低至中等</strong><br>1800-3200 mg/L<br>絲綢般</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#c0392b'>高且粗獷</strong><br>3500-5200 mg/L<br>年輕時緊澀</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>3️⃣ 酸度表現</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#27ae60'>中至高</strong><br>pH 3.3-3.6<br>TA 5.5-6.8 g/L</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#f39c12'>高</strong><br>pH 3.2-3.5<br>TA 6.0-7.5 g/L</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#c0392b'>極高</strong><br>pH 3.1-3.4<br>TA 6.5-8.0 g/L</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8f9fa'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>4️⃣ 酒體-酒精度</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong>中至飽滿</strong><br>13.0-14.5% ABV<br>圓潤質地</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong>輕至中等</strong><br>12.5-14.0% ABV<br>輕盈質地</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong>飽滿強勁</strong><br>13.5-15.0% ABV<br>厚重質地</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>5️⃣ 成熟期</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong>中晚熟</strong><br>9月底-10月初<br>需溫暖氣候</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong>早熟</strong><br>9月初-中<br>怕過度成熟</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong>極晚熟</strong><br>10月中-下旬<br>需長成熟期</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8f9fa'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>6️⃣ 核心風味</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>🍒<strong>紅櫻桃</strong><br>🍓<strong>草莓</strong><br>🌸<strong>紫羅蘭</strong><br>🌿<strong>草本</strong><br>🧂<strong>海鹽礦物</strong></td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>🍓<strong>紅莓</strong><br>🍒<strong>櫻桃</strong><br>🌹<strong>玫瑰</strong><br>🍄<strong>森林地表</strong><br>🌰<strong>香料</strong></td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>🌹<strong>玫瑰</strong><br>🍒<strong>櫻桃</strong><br>☕<strong>焦油</strong><br>🍂<strong>乾燥香料</strong><br>🍄<strong>松露</strong></td></tr><tr style='background:#fff'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>7️⃣ 陳年潛力</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#27ae60'>良好</strong><br>頂級5-10年<br>Riserva 10-15年</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>優秀</strong><br>頂級10-20年<br>Grand Cru 20-30年</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>卓越</strong><br>頂級15-30年<br>Barolo 30-50年</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8f9fa'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>8️⃣ 氣候偏好</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong>地中海炎熱</strong><br>年均溫16-18°C<br>抗旱性強</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong>大陸涼爽</strong><br>年均溫10-12°C<br>需涼爽氣候</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong>大陸溫和</strong><br>年均溫11-13°C<br>需長日照</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>9️⃣ 價格區間</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#27ae60'>€8-35</strong><br>入門€8-15<br>頂級€20-35</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#c0392b'>€15-300+</strong><br>入門€15-30<br>Grand Cru €100-300+</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#c0392b'>€20-200+</strong><br>入門€20-40<br>Barolo €60-200+</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8f9fa'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>🔟 性價比評分</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#d4af37;font-size:1.3rem'>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</strong><br><span style='color:#27ae60'>極高性價比</span><br>被低估的寶石</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#f39c12;font-size:1.3rem'>⭐⭐⭐</strong><br><span style='color:#7f8c8d'>中等性價比</span><br>名氣溢價高</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#f39c12;font-size:1.3rem'>⭐⭐⭐⭐</strong><br><span style='color:#3498db'>較高性價比</span><br>質量與價格平衡</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px;margin-bottom:30px'><div><h3 style='color:#16a085;margin:0 0 20px;font-size:1.2rem'>🌸 芳香化合物分析</h3><div style='display:grid;gap:15px'><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fadbd8,#f5b7b1);padding:18px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #c0392b'><h4 style='margin:0 0 10px;color:#c0392b;font-size:1rem'>🍓 紅色水果調</h4><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.7;color:#2c3e50;font-size:.95rem'><strong>化合物：</strong>Ethyl octanoate, Hexyl acetate<br><strong>風味：</strong>紅櫻桃、草莓、覆盆莓<br><strong>濃度：</strong>450-680 μg/L</p></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8daef,#d2b4de);padding:18px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #8e44ad'><h4 style='margin:0 0 10px;color:#8e44ad;font-size:1rem'>🌸 花香調</h4><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.7;color:#2c3e50;font-size:.95rem'><strong>化合物：</strong>β-Ionone, Linalool<br><strong>風味：</strong>紫羅蘭、玫瑰花瓣、鳶尾花<br><strong>濃度：</strong>120-250 μg/L</p></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d5f4e6,#a3e4d7);padding:18px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #27ae60'><h4 style='margin:0 0 10px;color:#27ae60;font-size:1rem'>🌿 草本調</h4><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.7;color:#2c3e50;font-size:.95rem'><strong>化合物：</strong>Eucalyptol, Caryophyllene<br><strong>風味：</strong>乾燥草本、地中海灌木<br><strong>濃度：</strong>80-180 μg/L</p></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d6eaf8,#aed6f1);padding:18px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #3498db'><h4 style='margin:0 0 10px;color:#3498db;font-size:1rem'>🧂 礦物-海洋調</h4><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.7;color:#2c3e50;font-size:.95rem'><strong>來源：</strong>海風影響、石灰岩土壤<br><strong>風味：</strong>海鹽、濕石頭、潮濕礦物<br><strong>特點：</strong>Ionian海岸獨特標記</p></div></div></div><div><h3 style='color:#16a085;margin:0 0 20px;font-size:1.2rem'>🧬 3大克隆對比</h3><table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.9rem;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.08)'><thead><tr style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16a085,#1abc9c);color:#fff'><th style='padding:12px;text-align:left;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)'>克隆類型</th><th style='padding:12px;text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)'>風格特徵</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style='background:#fff'><td style='padding:12px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#d4af37'>🏺 Cirò經典克隆</td><td style='padding:12px;border:1px solid #ddd'><strong>產區：</strong>Cirò DOC核心區<br><strong>特點：</strong>平衡型、中等單寧<br><strong>風味：</strong>紅櫻桃+紫羅蘭+適度礦物<br><strong>陳年：</strong>5-10年</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8f9fa'><td style='padding:12px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#f39c12'>🔥 Lamezia濃郁克隆</td><td style='padding:12px;border:1px solid #ddd'><strong>產區：</strong>Lamezia DOC<br><strong>特點：</strong>顏色更深、單寧更高<br><strong>風味：</strong>黑櫻桃+巧克力+香料<br><strong>陳年：</strong>3-8年</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff'><td style='padding:12px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#3498db'>🌊 Savuto易飲克隆</td><td style='padding:12px;border:1px solid #ddd'><strong>產區：</strong>Savuto DOC<br><strong>特點：</strong>輕盈、早飲型<br><strong>風味：</strong>草莓+花香+清爽酸度<br><strong>陳年：</strong>1-4年</td></tr></tbody></table><div style='margin-top:20px;padding:18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff3cd,#ffe69c);border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #f39c12'><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.7;color:#2c3e50;font-size:.95rem'><strong style='color:#d35400'>💡 專業提示：</strong>Gaglioppo最大挑戰是<strong>氧化敏感性</strong>(薄皮+低花青素)，需要精確溫控發酵(20-24°C)和短浸皮時間(8-12天)，避免過度萃取。頂級酒莊使用<strong>重力流動</strong>+<strong>野生酵母</strong>+<strong>不過濾</strong>工藝保留風土特徵。</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide' style='background:#f8f9fa'><h2 style='color:#16a085;border-bottom:3px solid #1abc9c;padding-bottom:12px;margin-bottom:30px'>🏖️ Cirò產區風土科學：Ionian海岸石灰岩的奇蹟</h2><div style='background:#fff;padding:35px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.12)'><div style='margin-bottom:30px'><h3 style='color:#16a085;margin:0 0 20px;font-size:1.3rem;text-align:center'>🗺️ 地理位置與核心區劃分</h3><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:25px'><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8f8f5,#d1f2eb);padding:25px;border-radius:10px;border-left:5px solid #16a085'><h4 style='margin:0 0 15px;color:#16a085;font-size:1.15rem'>🌊 Ionian海東岸核心帶</h4><p style='margin:0 0 15px;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50'><strong style='color:#16a085'>地理座標：</strong>39.4°N, 17.0°E<br><strong style='color:#16a085'>海拔範圍：</strong>150-400m丘陵地帶<br><strong style='color:#16a085'>核心城鎮：</strong>Cirò、Cirò Marina<br><strong style='color:#16a085'>Ionian海距離：</strong>2-8km(海風影響顯著)<br><strong style='color:#16a085'>總面積：</strong>1,850公頃(DOC認證區)</p><div style='background:rgba(22,160,133,.1);padding:15px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:15px'><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.7;color:#2c3e50;font-size:.95rem'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>🏛️ Cirò Classico核心區：</strong><br>5個村莊黃金帶(Cirò, Cirò Marina, Melissa, Crucoli, Verzino)海拔<strong style='color:#c0392b'>200-350m</strong>最佳坡地，<strong style='color:#c0392b'>80%頂級Cirò Classico Superiore</strong>來源於此，老藤(50-120年)集中區。</p></div></div><div style='display:grid;gap:15px'><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff3cd,#ffe69c);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.08)'><div style='font-size:2.2rem;margin-bottom:8px'>1,850ha</div><div style='font-size:.95rem;color:#2c3e50;font-weight:600'>Cirò DOC總面積</div></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fadbd8,#f5b7b1);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.08)'><div style='font-size:2.2rem;margin-bottom:8px'>650ha</div><div style='font-size:.95rem;color:#2c3e50;font-weight:600'>Classico核心區</div></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d6eaf8,#aed6f1);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.08)'><div style='font-size:2.2rem;margin-bottom:8px'>2-8km</div><div style='font-size:.95rem;color:#2c3e50;font-weight:600'>距Ionian海</div></div></div></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:30px'><h3 style='color:#16a085;margin:0 0 20px;font-size:1.3rem;text-align:center'>🪨 土壤分析：石灰岩主導 vs Vulture火山土對比</h3><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:25px'><div><h4 style='margin:0 0 15px;color:#16a085;font-size:1.1rem;text-align:center'>🏖️ Cirò石灰岩土壤</h4><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f5f5dc,#e8e8d0);padding:25px;border-radius:10px;border-top:5px solid #d4af37'><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px'><span style='font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50'>石灰岩 (Calcareous)</span><span style='font-weight:700;color:#d4af37;font-size:1.1rem'>60%</span></div><div style='background:#ecf0f1;height:20px;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden'><div style='background:linear-gradient(90deg,#d4af37,#f39c12);width:60%;height:100%'></div></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px'><span style='font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50'>粘土 (Clay)</span><span style='font-weight:700;color:#e67e22;font-size:1.1rem'>30%</span></div><div style='background:#ecf0f1;height:20px;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden'><div style='background:linear-gradient(90deg,#e67e22,#d68910);width:30%;height:100%'></div></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px'><span style='font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50'>砂質 (Sand)</span><span style='font-weight:700;color:#95a5a6;font-size:1.1rem'>10%</span></div><div style='background:#ecf0f1;height:20px;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden'><div style='background:linear-gradient(90deg,#95a5a6,#7f8c8d);width:10%;height:100%'></div></div></div><div style='background:rgba(22,160,133,.15);padding:15px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:20px'><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.7;color:#2c3e50;font-size:.95rem'><strong style='color:#16a085'>pH值：</strong>7.5-8.2(鹼性)<br><strong style='color:#16a085'>排水性：</strong>優秀(石灰岩多孔)<br><strong style='color:#16a085'>保水性：</strong>中等(粘土輔助)<br><strong style='color:#16a085'>礦物質：</strong>鈣、鎂豐富<br><strong style='color:#16a085'>風味影響：</strong>海鹽礦物、潮濕石頭、清爽酸度</p></div></div></div><div><h4 style='margin:0 0 15px;color:#c0392b;font-size:1.1rem;text-align:center'>🌋 Vulture火山土壤(對比)</h4><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#34495e,#2c3e50);color:#ecf0f1;padding:25px;border-radius:10px;border-top:5px solid #c0392b'><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px'><span style='font-weight:600'>火山灰 (Volcanic)</span><span style='font-weight:700;color:#e74c3c;font-size:1.1rem'>70%</span></div><div style='background:rgba(236,240,241,.2);height:20px;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden'><div style='background:linear-gradient(90deg,#e74c3c,#c0392b);width:70%;height:100%'></div></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px'><span style='font-weight:600'>砂質-礫石</span><span style='font-weight:700;color:#95a5a6;font-size:1.1rem'>25%</span></div><div style='background:rgba(236,240,241,.2);height:20px;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden'><div style='background:linear-gradient(90deg,#95a5a6,#7f8c8d);width:25%;height:100%'></div></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px'><span style='font-weight:600'>粘土</span><span style='font-weight:700;color:#e67e22;font-size:1.1rem'>5%</span></div><div style='background:rgba(236,240,241,.2);height:20px;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden'><div style='background:linear-gradient(90deg,#e67e22,#d68910);width:5%;height:100%'></div></div></div><div style='background:rgba(192,57,43,.2);padding:15px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:20px;border:1px solid rgba(231,76,60,.3)'><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.7;font-size:.95rem'><strong style='color:#e74c3c'>pH值：</strong>5.5-6.8(酸性)<br><strong style='color:#e74c3c'>排水性：</strong>極佳(火山岩多孔)<br><strong style='color:#e74c3c'>保水性：</strong>低<br><strong style='color:#e74c3c'>礦物質：</strong>鐵、鉀、磷豐富<br><strong style='color:#e74c3c'>風味影響：</strong>煙燻、火山礦物、深色水果(Aglianico)</p></div></div></div></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:30px'><h3 style='color:#16a085;margin:0 0 20px;font-size:1.3rem;text-align:center'>🌡️ 氣候數據：地中海炎熱型+Ionian海風調節</h3><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px;margin-bottom:25px'><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff3cd,#ffe69c);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;border-top:4px solid #f39c12'><div style='font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:8px'>🌡️</div><div style='font-size:1.8rem;color:#d35400;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:5px'>16-17°C</div><div style='font-size:.9rem;color:#2c3e50;font-weight:600'>年均溫</div><div style='font-size:.85rem;color:#7f8c8d;margin-top:8px'>夏季峰值38-42°C<br>冬季谷底5-8°C</div></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d6eaf8,#aed6f1);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;border-top:4px solid #3498db'><div style='font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:8px'>🌅</div><div style='font-size:1.8rem;color:#2980b9;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:5px'>10-15°C</div><div style='font-size:.9rem;color:#2c3e50;font-weight:600'>日夜溫差</div><div style='font-size:.85rem;color:#7f8c8d;margin-top:8px'>收成期(9-10月)<br>保留酸度+風味</div></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d5f4e6,#a3e4d7);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;border-top:4px solid #27ae60'><div style='font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:8px'>🌊</div><div style='font-size:1.8rem;color:#16a085;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:5px'>2-8km</div><div style='font-size:.9rem;color:#2c3e50;font-weight:600'>海風影響區</div><div style='font-size:.85rem;color:#7f8c8d;margin-top:8px'>Ionian海風調節<br>降溫+海洋風味</div></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ebf5fb,#d6eaf8);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;border-top:4px solid #5dade2'><div style='font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:8px'>💧</div><div style='font-size:1.8rem;color:#3498db;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:5px'>600-750mm</div><div style='font-size:.9rem;color:#2c3e50;font-weight:600'>年降雨量</div><div style='font-size:.85rem;color:#7f8c8d;margin-top:8px'>冬季集中(10-3月)<br>夏季乾燥</div></div></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8f8f5,#d1f2eb);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;border-left:5px solid #1abc9c;margin-bottom:30px'><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50'><strong style='color:#16a085;font-size:1.05rem'>🌬️ Ionian海風的三大作用：</strong><br>1️⃣ <strong>溫度調節：</strong>夏季午後海風降溫3-5°C，防止過度成熟和酸度流失<br>2️⃣ <strong>濕度控制：</strong>早晨海霧提供適度濕度，日間迅速蒸發，減少病害(霜黴病風險低50%)<br>3️⃣ <strong>海洋風味：</strong>海鹽氣溶膠附著葡萄皮，帶來獨特的海鹽礦物風味(Cirò標誌性特徵)</p></div></div><div><h3 style='color:#16a085;margin:0 0 20px;font-size:1.3rem;text-align:center'>🏆 Cirò DOC vs Classico Superiore 等級對比</h3><table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.95rem;box-shadow:0 6px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.12)'><thead><tr style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16a085,#1abc9c);color:#fff'><th style='padding:15px;text-align:left;font-size:1.05rem;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)'>等級/規範</th><th style='padding:15px;text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)'>🍷 Cirò DOC<br><span style='font-size:.85rem;font-weight:400'>(基礎版)</span></th><th style='padding:15px;text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)'>🏅 Cirò Classico<br><span style='font-size:.85rem;font-weight:400'>(核心產區)</span></th><th style='padding:15px;text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)'>👑 Classico Superiore Riserva<br><span style='font-size:.85rem;font-weight:400'>(最高等級)</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style='background:#fff'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>產區範圍</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>全Cirò產區<br>1,850公頃</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>5村莊核心區</strong><br>650公頃</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>最佳坡地</strong><br>200-350m海拔</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8f9fa'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>品種比例</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>Gaglioppo 80%+<br>可混Greco Nero等</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>Gaglioppo 90%+<br>更純粹</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#c0392b'>Gaglioppo 95%+</strong><br>幾乎單一品種</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>產量限制</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#e67e22'>90 hl/ha</strong><br>(較寬鬆)</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#f39c12'>75 hl/ha</strong><br>(中等嚴格)</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#c0392b'>70 hl/ha</strong><br>(極嚴格)</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8f9fa'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>陳年要求</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong>0個月</strong><br>可即時上市</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong>6個月</strong><br>基礎陳年</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>24個月+</strong><br>(至少6月橡木桶)</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>最低酒精度</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>12.5% ABV</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>13.0% ABV</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#c0392b'>13.5% ABV</strong></td></tr><tr style='background:#f8f9fa'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>風味複雜度</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>簡單果香<br>紅櫻桃+草莓</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>中等複雜度<br>+紫羅蘭+草本</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>高度複雜</strong><br>+皮革+煙草<br>+礦物+香料</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>陳年潛力</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>1-3年<br>即飲型</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>3-7年<br>中期陳年</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>5-15年</strong><br>長期陳年</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8f9fa'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>價格區間</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center;color:#27ae60;font-size:1.05rem'><strong>€8-15</strong><br>入門級</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center;color:#f39c12;font-size:1.05rem'><strong>€15-25</strong><br>中階</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center;color:#c0392b;font-size:1.05rem'><strong>€20-35</strong><br>頂級</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff3cd'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#d35400'>推薦生產者</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center;font-size:.9rem'>Ippolito 1845<br>Caparra &amp; Siciliani</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center;font-size:.9rem'>Librandi<br>Ceraudo<br>Sergio Arcuri</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center;font-size:.9rem'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>A Vita</strong><br><strong style='color:#d4af37'>Cote di Franze</strong><br><strong style='color:#d4af37'>Senatore Vini</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style='margin-top:25px;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fadbd8,#f5b7b1);border-radius:10px;border-left:5px solid #c0392b'><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50'><strong style='color:#c0392b;font-size:1.1rem'>🎯 專業選酒建議：</strong><br><strong style='color:#27ae60'>入門探索(€8-15):</strong> Cirò DOC基礎版，了解Gaglioppo基本風格<br><strong style='color:#f39c12'>品質升級(€15-25):</strong> Cirò Classico，感受核心產區風土差異<br><strong style='color:#d4af37'>深度體驗(€20-35):</strong> Classico Superiore Riserva，探索Gaglioppo陳年潛力與複雜度<br><strong style='color:#8e44ad'>極致追求(€35+):</strong> 老藤單一園(80-120年老藤)，如A Vita &quot;Federico II&quot;、Senatore &quot;San Lorenzo&quot;</p></div></div></section><section class='slide calabria-map-slide' style='padding:0'><div class='calabria-map-container' style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:20px;height:100%;padding:20px;background:#1a1a2e;border-radius:12px'><div id='calabria-map' class='calabria-region-map' style='border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.3)'></div><div class='map-legend'><h3 style='margin:0 0 20px;color:#16a085;font-size:1.3rem;text-align:center'>🌊 Calabria 產區地圖</h3><div style='margin-bottom:25px;padding:15px;background:rgba(22,160,133,.15);border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #16a085'><p style='margin:0;color:#ecf0f1;line-height:1.7;font-size:.95rem'>義大利腳尖，古老品種寶庫（2500年歷史）</p></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#d4af37;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #d4af37;padding-bottom:8px'>🏆 S級 DOCG</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(212,175,55,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #d4af37'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#d4af37;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#d4af37'>Cirò DOCG</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>古希臘奧運選手的酒</p></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#c0392b;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #c0392b;padding-bottom:8px'>⭐ A級產區</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(192,57,43,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #c0392b'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#c0392b;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#c0392b'>Cirò DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>Gaglioppo紅葡萄之王</p></div><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(243,156,18,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #f39c12'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#f39c12;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#f39c12'>Greco di Bianco DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>稀有甜白酒，17%+酒精度</p></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#8e44ad;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #8e44ad;padding-bottom:8px'>✨ B級產區</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(142,68,173,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #8e44ad'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#8e44ad;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#8e44ad'>Lamezia DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>Magliocco濃郁版本</p></div><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(52,152,219,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #3498db'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#3498db;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#3498db'>Bivongi DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>Ionian海岸Passito</p></div><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(46,204,113,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #2ecc71'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#2ecc71;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#2ecc71'>Savuto DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>Tyrrhenian海西岸</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🥾 義大利的「腳尖」</h2><div class='region-intro'><div class='intro-text'><p>Calabria（卡拉布里亞）位於義大利半島最南端（「靴子」的<strong>腳尖</strong>部分），夾在<strong>Ionian 海</strong>和<strong>Tyrrhenian 海</strong>之間，擁有<strong>2500 年葡萄酒歷史</strong>，但現代產業落後。</p><p class='highlight'>🍇 Calabria 特點：<strong>古老本土品種的寶庫</strong>（Gaglioppo、Greco Bianco、Magliocco），但產業規模小、國際知名度低。</p></div><div class='calabria-stats'><div class='stat-card'><div class='stat-icon'>🏺</div><div class='stat-value'>2500 年</div><div class='stat-label'>葡萄酒歷史<br>（古希臘時期）</div></div><div class='stat-card'><div class='stat-icon'>🍷</div><div class='stat-value'>12 DOC</div><div class='stat-label'>沒有 DOCG<br>（品質認證較少）</div></div><div class='stat-card'><div class='stat-icon'>🌊</div><div class='stat-value'>800km</div><div class='stat-label'>海岸線<br>（雙海包圍）</div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 Cirò DOC - Calabria 最知名產區</h2><div class='ciro-section'><div class='ciro-intro'><h3>🏺 古希臘奧運選手的酒</h3><p>Cirò DOC 位於 Calabria 東海岸（Ionian 海），是 Calabria <strong>最古老、最知名</strong>的產區。傳說<strong>古希臘奧運選手</strong>在比賽後會飲用 Cirò 葡萄酒慶祝（當時稱為 Cremissa）。</p></div><div class='ciro-wines'><div class='wine-type rosso'><h4>🍷 Cirò Rosso DOC</h4><div class='wine-info'><p><strong>品種：</strong>Gaglioppo（95%+），可混 Greco Nero、Trebbiano</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>中至飽滿酒體、果香豐富、單寧柔順</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>紅櫻桃、草莓、香料、草本、皮革、礦物</p><p><strong>酒精度：</strong>13-14%</p><p><strong>Classico Superiore Riserva：</strong>陳年 2 年，品質更高</p></div></div><div class='wine-type rosato'><h4>🌸 Cirò Rosato DOC</h4><div class='wine-info'><p><strong>品種：</strong>Gaglioppo（100%）</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>清爽、果香、夏季飲用</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>草莓、櫻桃、西瓜、花香</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>Calabria 最受歡迎的粉紅酒</p></div></div><div class='wine-type bianco'><h4>⚪ Cirò Bianco DOC</h4><div class='wine-info'><p><strong>品種：</strong>Greco Bianco（90%+）</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>清爽、花香、礦物感</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>檸檬、白桃、杏仁、海鹽</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>產量較小，不如紅酒知名</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 Gaglioppo - Calabria 的紅葡萄之王</h2><div class='gaglioppo-section'><div class='gaglioppo-intro'><h3>🍷 被低估的優質品種</h3><p>Gaglioppo 是 Calabria 的<strong>代表性紅葡萄品種</strong>，佔該區紅酒產量 80%+，但長期被忽視，近年重獲重視。</p></div><div class='gaglioppo-features'><div class='feature-box'><h4>🍇 品種特性</h4><ul><li><strong>顏色：</strong>相對較淡（類似 Pinot Noir、Nebbiolo）</li><li><strong>單寧：</strong>中等、柔順</li><li><strong>酸度：</strong>中至高</li><li><strong>酒精度：</strong>13-14%</li><li><strong>成熟期：</strong>中晚熟（9 月底-10 月初）</li><li><strong>抗旱性：</strong>強（適合炎熱氣候）</li></ul></div><div class='feature-box'><h4>🍷 風味特徵</h4><p><strong>年輕時：</strong>紅櫻桃、草莓、覆盆莓、紫羅蘭、香料</p><p><strong>陳年後（5-10 年）：</strong>皮革、煙草、乾花、礦物、草本</p><p class='note'>💡 Gaglioppo 被稱為「南義的 Pinot Noir」，因顏色較淡、單寧柔順、風味細膩。</p></div><div class='feature-box'><h4>🌟 頂級生產者</h4><ul><li><strong>Librandi</strong>（Gravello - Gaglioppo + Cabernet 混釀）</li><li><strong>A Vita</strong>（自然派）</li><li><strong>Ippolito 1845</strong>（歷史悠久）</li><li><strong>Ceraudo</strong>（有機、生物動力法）</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 其他 Calabria 本土品種</h2><div class='native-grapes'><div class='grape-card red'><h3>🔴 Magliocco</h3><div class='grape-info'><p><strong>類型：</strong>紅葡萄品種</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>濃郁、果香爆炸、單寧高</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>黑櫻桃、黑莓、李子、巧克力、香料</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>顏色極深、酒精度高（14-15%）</p><p><strong>產區：</strong>Lamezia DOC</p><p><strong>用途：</strong>單一品種酒或與 Gaglioppo 混釀增加顏色和濃郁度</p></div></div><div class='grape-card white'><h3>⚪ Greco Bianco</h3><div class='grape-info'><p><strong>類型：</strong>白葡萄品種（不同於 Campania 的 Greco di Tufo）</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>果香豐富、酒體飽滿、陳年潛力佳</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>白桃、杏桃、柑橘、蜂蜜、杏仁、礦物</p><p><strong>產區：</strong>Greco di Bianco DOC（甜酒版本）</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>Calabria 最高品質的白葡萄品種</p></div></div><div class='grape-card white'><h3>⚪ Mantonico</h3><div class='grape-info'><p><strong>類型：</strong>白葡萄品種</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>芳香、果香豐富、可釀造甜酒</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>柑橘、白花、蜂蜜、杏桃</p><p><strong>產區：</strong>Bivongi DOC</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>適合釀造晚採收甜酒（Passito）</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide' style='background:#f8f9fa'><h2 style='color:#16a085;border-bottom:3px solid #1abc9c;padding-bottom:12px;margin-bottom:30px'>🍇 Calabria本土品種寶庫 - 三大珍稀品種深度剖析</h2><div style='background:#fff;padding:35px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.12)'><div style='margin-bottom:35px'><h3 style='color:#16a085;margin:0 0 25px;font-size:1.4rem;text-align:center'>🍇 Part A: Magliocco品種 - 深紫黑色的力量之源</h3><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px'><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2c3e50,#34495e);color:#ecf0f1;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.3)'><h4 style='margin:0 0 20px;color:#1abc9c;font-size:1.3rem;border-底:2px solid #16a085;padding-bottom:10px'>🌱 起源與核心產區</h4><div style='background:rgba(22,160,133,.15);padding:20px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #1abc9c;margin-bottom:20px'><p style='margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05rem'><strong style='color:#1abc9c'>起源：</strong>Calabria獨有古老品種</p><p style='margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05rem'><strong style='color:#1abc9c'>核心產區：</strong>Lamezia DOC中心地帶</p><p style='margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05rem'><strong style='color:#1abc9c'>種植面積：</strong>850公頃(僅佔Calabria 7.7%)</p><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05rem'><strong style='color:#1abc9c'>稀缺度：</strong>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ 極度稀有</p></div><div style='background:rgba(192,57,43,.2);padding:20px;border-radius:8px;border:2px solid #c0392b'><h5 style='margin:0 0 15px;color:#e74c3c;font-size:1.15rem'>🧬 品種特性數據</h5><div style='display:grid;gap:12px'><div style='background:rgba(0,0,0,.3);padding:12px 15px;border-radius:6px'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>花青素濃度：</strong><span style='color:#fff;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700'>5500-7200 mg/L</span><br><span style='font-size:.9rem;color:#bdc3c7'>(Gaglioppo的2倍濃度)</span></div><div style='background:rgba(0,0,0,.3);padding:12px 15px;border-radius:6px'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>單寧含量：</strong><span style='color:#fff;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700'>4200-5800 mg/L</span><br><span style='font-size:.9rem;color:#bdc3c7'>高單寧、需時間柔化</span></div><div style='background:rgba(0,0,0,.3);padding:12px 15px;border-radius:6px'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>酒精度：</strong><span style='color:#fff;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700'>14.0-15.5% ABV</span><br><span style='font-size:.9rem;color:#bdc3c7'>炎熱氣候高糖分累積</span></div></div></div></div><div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8e44ad,#9b59b6);color:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(142,68,173,.3);margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 15px;font-size:1.2rem;border-bottom:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);padding-bottom:8px'>🍷 核心風味譜系</h4><div style='display:grid;gap:10px'><div style='background:rgba(0,0,0,.2);padding:12px 15px;border-radius:6px;border-left:4px solid #e74c3c'><strong>🍇 黑色水果主導：</strong>黑莓、黑櫻桃、成熟李子</div><div style='background:rgba(0,0,0,.2);padding:12px 15px;border-radius:6px;border-left:4px solid #8e44ad'><strong>🍫 甜香料層：</strong>黑巧克力(70%+可可)、甘草、丁香</div><div style='background:rgba(0,0,0,.2);padding:12px 15px;border-radius:6px;border-left:4px solid #d35400'><strong>🌿 草本-煙熏：</strong>地中海草本、煙草葉、烤橡木</div><div style='background:rgba(0,0,0,.2);padding:12px 15px;border-radius:6px;border-left:4px solid #16a085'><strong>🧂 礦物尾韻：</strong>濕石板、鐵質礦物</div></div></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8f8f5,#d1f2eb);padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border-top:5px solid #16a085'><h4 style='margin:0 0 15px;color:#16a085;font-size:1.2rem'>🏆 代表酒莊與酒款</h4><div style='display:grid;gap:15px'><div style='background:#fff;padding:15px;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.08);border-left:4px solid #d4af37'><p style='margin:0;color:#2c3e50;line-height:1.7'><strong style='color:#d4af37;font-size:1.05rem'>🥇 Statti</strong><br><span style='font-size:.95rem'>Magliocco Riserva 24月橡木桶<br>€28-38 | Parker 90分</span></p></div><div style='background:#fff;padding:15px;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.08);border-left:4px solid #c0392b'><p style='margin:0;color:#2c3e50;line-height:1.7'><strong style='color:#c0392b;font-size:1.05rem'>🥈 Feudo dei Sanseverino</strong><br><span style='font-size:.95rem'>100% Magliocco單一園<br>€22-32 | Gambero Rosso 2杯</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:35px'><h3 style='color:#16a085;margin:0 0 25px;font-size:1.4rem;text-align:center'>⚪ Part B: Greco Bianco品種 - 古希臘的液體黃金</h3><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:25px'><div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f39c12,#f1c40f);color:#2c3e50;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 15px rgba(243,156,18,.3);margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 20px;font-size:1.3rem;border-bottom:2px solid rgba(44,62,80,.2);padding-bottom:10px'>🏺 起源與品種差異</h4><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);padding:20px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:15px'><p style='margin:0 0 15px;line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05rem'><strong style='color:#d35400'>古希臘起源：</strong>BC 8世紀Magna Graecia殖民者引入</p><p style='margin:0 0 15px;line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05rem'><strong style='color:#c0392b'>重要區別：</strong>與Campania的<strong>Greco di Tufo</strong>為<strong>不同品種</strong></p><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05rem'><strong style='color:#16a085'>DNA分析：</strong>無親緣關係，僅名稱相似</p></div><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:15px'><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.8);padding:15px;border-radius:8px;text-align:center'><div style='font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:8px'>🌡️</div><div style='font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:#d35400;margin-bottom:5px'>12.5-14%</div><div style='font-size:.9rem;color:#7f8c8d'>酒精度ABV</div></div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.8);padding:15px;border-radius:8px;text-align:center'><div style='font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:8px'>⚖️</div><div style='font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:#16a085;margin-bottom:5px'>中-飽滿</div><div style='font-size:.9rem;color:#7f8c8d'>酒體結構</div></div></div></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d6eaf8,#ebf5fb);padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border-left:5px solid #3498db'><h4 style='margin:0 0 15px;color:#3498db;font-size:1.2rem'>🍑 風味特徵光譜</h4><div style='display:grid;gap:12px'><div style='background:#fff;padding:12px 15px;border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.08)'><strong style='color:#f39c12'>🍑 核心果香：</strong>白桃、成熟杏桃、金黃蘋果</div><div style='background:#fff;padding:12px 15px;border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.08)'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>🍯 次層甜香：</strong>洋槐蜂蜜、橙花、茉莉花</div><div style='background:#fff;padding:12px 15px;border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.08)'><strong style='color:#3498db'>🧂 海洋礦物：</strong>海鹽風味、潮濕岩石、鹹鮮尾韻</div></div></div></div><div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fef5e7,#fdebd0);padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border:3px solid #f39c12;box-shadow:0 6px 15px rgba(243,156,18,.25)'><h4 style='margin:0 0 20px;color:#d35400;font-size:1.25rem;text-align:center;border-bottom:2px solid #f39c12;padding-bottom:10px'>🍯 Greco di Bianco DOC深度檔案</h4><div style='background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:15px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.1)'><h5 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#c0392b;font-size:1.1rem'>🍇 釀造工藝</h5><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50;font-size:.95rem'><strong>Appassimento風乾：</strong>1-2週<br><strong>殘糖：</strong>100-150 g/L(極甜)<br><strong>酒精度：</strong><span style='color:#c0392b;font-weight:700'>17%+</span>(義大利最高之一)<br><strong>陳年潛力：</strong>10-20年+</p></div><div style='background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:15px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.1)'><h5 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#8e44ad;font-size:1.1rem'>🍷 風味深度</h5><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50;font-size:.95rem'>杏桃乾、無花果、焦糖蜂蜜、橙花水、烤杏仁、琥珀色澤</p></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fadbd8,#f5b7b1);padding:18px;border-radius:8px;text-align:center'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:700;color:#c0392b;margin-bottom:8px'>€25-60</div><div style='font-size:.9rem;color:#2c3e50'>每50ml小瓶價格<br><span style='font-size:.85rem;color:#7f8c8d'>產量極稀少 年產&lt;15,000瓶</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><h3 style='color:#16a085;margin:0 0 25px;font-size:1.4rem;text-align:center'>🌸 Part C: Mantonico品種 - Ionian海岸的芳香珍寶</h3><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-bottom:25px'><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8daef,#d2b4de);padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border-top:5px solid #8e44ad;text-align:center'><div style='font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:12px'>🗺️</div><h4 style='margin:0 0 15px;color:#8e44ad;font-size:1.15rem'>核心產區</h4><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50;font-size:.95rem'><strong>Bivongi DOC</strong><br>Ionian海岸南部<br>Locride地區專屬</p></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fef5e7,#fdebd0);padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border-top:5px solid #f39c12;text-align:center'><div style='font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:12px'>🍯</div><h4 style='margin:0 0 15px;color:#f39c12;font-size:1.15rem'>釀造風格</h4><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50;font-size:.95rem'><strong>Passito甜酒</strong><br>風乾2-3週<br>殘糖80-120 g/L</p></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d5f4e6,#a3e4d7);padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border-top:5px solid #27ae60;text-align:center'><div style='font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:12px'>🌸</div><h4 style='margin:0 0 15px;color:#27ae60;font-size:1.15rem'>芳香類型</h4><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50;font-size:.95rem'><strong>高芳香型</strong><br>柑橘花、蜂蜜<br>成熟杏桃香氣</p></div></div></div><div><h3 style='color:#16a085;margin:0 0 20px;font-size:1.3rem;text-align:center'>📊 三大品種終極對比表</h3><table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.92rem;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.15)'><thead><tr style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16a085,#1abc9c);color:#fff'><th style='padding:15px;text-align:left;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)'>對比維度</th><th style='padding:15px;text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)'>🍇 Magliocco</th><th style='padding:15px;text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)'>⚪ Greco Bianco</th><th style='padding:15px;text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)'>🌸 Mantonico</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style='background:#fff'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>🎨 顏色深度</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#8e44ad'>深紫黑</strong><br>5500-7200 mg/L花青素</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#f39c12'>金黃-琥珀</strong><br>(Passito版本)</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#f1c40f'>稻草黃-金黃</strong></td></tr><tr style='background:#f8f9fa'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>💪 單寧/酸度</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#c0392b'>高單寧</strong><br>4200-5800 mg/L<br>需陳年柔化</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#27ae60'>高酸度</strong><br>清爽平衡<br>中至飽滿酒體</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#f39c12'>中等酸度</strong><br>甜美柔順</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>🌡️ 酒精度</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#e74c3c'>14.0-15.5%</strong><br>高酒精強勁型</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#3498db'>12.5-14%</strong>(干型)<br><strong style='color:#c0392b'>17%+</strong>(Passito)</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#f39c12'>13.5-15.5%</strong><br>(Passito版本)</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8f9fa'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>🍷 核心風味</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>黑莓/李子<br>黑巧克力/煙熏</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>白桃/杏桃<br>蜂蜜/海鹽礦物</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>柑橘花/蜂蜜<br>杏桃/白花</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>📅 陳年潛力</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>5-12年</strong><br>Riserva更長</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong>3-8年</strong>(干型)<br><strong style='color:#d4af37'>10-20年</strong>(Passito)</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong>5-15年</strong><br>(Passito版本)</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8f9fa'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>💶 價格區間</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center;color:#c0392b;font-size:1.05rem'><strong>€22-38</strong></td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center;color:#f39c12;font-size:1.05rem'><strong>€12-20</strong>(干型)<br><strong>€25-60</strong>(Passito)</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center;color:#8e44ad;font-size:1.05rem'><strong>€18-35</strong></td></tr><tr style='background:#fff3cd'><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#d35400'>⭐ 稀缺度</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</strong><br>850公頃極稀有</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#f39c12'>⭐⭐⭐⭐</strong><br>2,200公頃稀有</td><td style='padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#e74c3c'>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</strong><br>&lt;400公頃極度稀缺</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style='margin-top:25px;padding:25px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d1f2eb,#a3e4d7);border-radius:12px;border-left:6px solid #16a085;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(22,160,133,.2)'><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.9;color:#2c3e50;font-size:1.05rem'><strong style='color:#16a085;font-size:1.2rem'>💡 專業選酒策略：</strong><br><strong style='color:#8e44ad'>探索Magliocco：</strong>選擇Statti或Feudo dei Sanseverino的Riserva版本，體驗南義「小Amarone」般的濃郁與複雜度，適合搭配烤肉與陳年起司<br><strong style='color:#f39c12'>Greco Bianco雙面：</strong>干型版本(€12-20)適合日常海鮮佐餐，Greco di Bianco DOC Passito(€25-60/50ml)則是甜酒收藏家必備的稀世珍品<br><strong style='color:#d35400'>深挖Mantonico：</strong>Bivongi DOC Passito產量極少，遇到就該入手，橙花與蜂蜜香氣完美搭配Ricotta起司甜點</p></div></div></section><section class='slide' style='background:#f8f9fa'><h2 style='color:#16a085;border-bottom:3px solid #1abc9c;padding-bottom:12px;margin-bottom:30px'>🏛️ 傳奇名莊巡禮 - 5大精品酒莊完整檔案</h2><div style='background:#fff;padding:35px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.12)'><div style='margin-bottom:30px'><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:25px'><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3498db,#2980b9);color:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 15px rgba(52,152,219,.4);border:3px solid #2c3e50'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:20px'><h3 style='margin:0;font-size:1.5rem'>🏆 Librandi</h3><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);padding:8px 16px;border-radius:20px;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600'>現代化先驅</div></div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:15px'><p style='margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05rem'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>創立年份：</strong>1950年(第三代經營)</p><p style='margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05rem'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>規模：</strong>232公頃(Calabria最大精品莊)</p><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05rem'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>哲學：</strong>本土品種+國際技術結合</p></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c0392b,#e74c3c);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:15px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 15px;font-size:1.2rem;border-bottom:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);padding-bottom:8px'>🍷 旗艦酒款：Gravello</h4><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.8;font-size:.95rem'><strong>混釀：</strong>Gaglioppo 60% + Cabernet Sauvignon 40%<br><strong>首發年份：</strong>1988(Calabria國際化里程碑)<br><strong>陳年：</strong>法國橡木桶18月<br><strong style='color:#d4af37'>Parker評分：</strong>90分(1995年份)<br><strong>價格：</strong>€35-50<br><strong>陳年潛力：</strong>10-15年</p></div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);padding:18px;border-radius:8px;text-align:center'><div style='font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:8px'>🎫 酒莊參訪</div><div style='font-size:2rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:5px'>€15</div><div style='font-size:.9rem;opacity:.9'>含3款酒品鑑+導覽(90分鐘)</div></div></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#27ae60,#229954);color:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 15px rgba(39,174,96,.4);border:3px solid #1e8449'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:20px'><h3 style='margin:0;font-size:1.5rem'>🌱 A Vita</h3><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.25);padding:8px 16px;border-radius:20px;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600'>自然派標竿</div></div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:15px'><p style='margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05rem'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>創立年份：</strong>2011年(Alberto Longo創辦)</p><p style='margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05rem'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>規模：</strong>6公頃精品小莊</p><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05rem'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>哲學：</strong>Zero Zero(零SO₂/零澄清/零過濾)</p></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8e44ad,#9b59b6);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:15px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 15px;font-size:1.2rem;border-bottom:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);padding-bottom:8px'>🍷 核心酒款：Rosso</h4><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.8;font-size:.95rem'><strong>品種：</strong>100% Gaglioppo(老藤60-80年)<br><strong>釀造：</strong>野生酵母自然發酵+陶罐陳年<br><strong>無添加：</strong>零SO₂、不澄清、不過濾<br><strong style='color:#d4af37'>Wine Enthusiast：</strong>91分<br><strong>價格：</strong>€22-32<br><strong>風格：</strong>純淨Gaglioppo本質、活潑有機感</p></div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);padding:18px;border-radius:8px'><div style='font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:8px'>🎫 酒莊參訪</div><div style='font-size:2rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:5px'>€20</div><div style='font-size:.9rem;opacity:.9'>Alberto本人接待率<strong style='color:#d4af37'>50%</strong><br>葡萄園徒步+自然派哲學講解</div></div></div></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:30px'><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px'><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d4af37,#f39c12);color:#2c3e50;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(212,175,55,.3);border-top:5px solid #d35400'><h3 style='margin:0 0 15px;font-size:1.3rem;color:#fff;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.3)'>🏺 Ippolito 1845</h3><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);padding:18px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:12px'><p style='margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.7;font-size:.95rem'><strong style='color:#d35400'>創立：</strong>1845年(179年歷史)</p><p style='margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.7;font-size:.95rem'><strong style='color:#d35400'>地位：</strong>Calabria最古老酒莊</p><p style='margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.7;font-size:.95rem'><strong style='color:#d35400'>世代：</strong>家族第6代經營</p><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.7;font-size:.95rem'><strong style='color:#d35400'>規模：</strong>100公頃+博物館</p></div><div style='background:rgba(192,57,43,.15);padding:15px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #c0392b;margin-bottom:12px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 10px;color:#c0392b;font-size:1.05rem'>🍷 旗艦：Liber Pater Riserva</h4><p style='margin:0;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.7'>100% Gaglioppo | 36月陳年<br>€28-40 | Gambero Rosso Tre Bicchieri</p></div><div style='background:rgba(52,152,219,.15);padding:12px;border-radius:6px;text-align:center'><strong>參訪€12</strong> | 含博物館導覽</div></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16a085,#1abc9c);color:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(22,160,133,.3);border-top:5px solid #138d75'><h3 style='margin:0 0 15px;font-size:1.3rem;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.2)'>🌾 Ceraudo</h3><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);padding:18px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:12px'><p style='margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.7;font-size:.95rem'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>創立：</strong>1973年(家族第三代)</p><p style='margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.7;font-size:.95rem'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>認證：</strong>有機+Demeter生物動力</p><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.7;font-size:.95rem'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>特色：</strong>Agriturismo農莊體驗</p></div><div style='background:rgba(142,68,173,.25);padding:15px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #8e44ad;margin-bottom:12px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 10px;font-size:1.05rem'>🍷 代表：Terravecchia</h4><p style='margin:0;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.7'>Gaglioppo+Magliocco+Greco Nero混釀<br>€30-45 | 生物動力法釀造</p></div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.25);padding:12px;border-radius:6px;text-align:center'><strong>參訪€25</strong><br><span style='font-size:.85rem'>Agriturismo午餐套餐€60</span></div></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8e44ad,#9b59b6);color:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(142,68,173,.3);border-top:5px solid #7d3c98'><h3 style='margin:0 0 15px;font-size:1.3rem;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.2)'>👑 Odoardi</h3><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);padding:18px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:12px'><p style='margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.7;font-size:.95rem'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>歷史：</strong>16世紀貴族家族</p><p style='margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.7;font-size:.95rem'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>地位：</strong>Calabria最古老貴族莊</p><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.7;font-size:.95rem'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>特色：</strong>歷史城堡+古老酒窖</p></div><div style='background:rgba(192,57,43,.2);padding:15px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #e74c3c;margin-bottom:12px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 10px;font-size:1.05rem'>🍷 明星：Vigna Mortilla</h4><p style='margin:0;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.7'>單一園300m海拔<br>100% Gaglioppo精釀<br>€25-38</p></div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.25);padding:12px;border-radius:6px;text-align:center'><strong>參訪€18</strong> | 城堡歷史導覽</div></div></div></div><div><h3 style='color:#16a085;margin:0 0 20px;font-size:1.3rem;text-align:center'>📊 5大酒莊終極比較矩陣</h3><table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.88rem;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.15)'><thead><tr style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16a085,#1abc9c);color:#fff'><th style='padding:12px;text-align:left;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)'>評比維度</th><th style='padding:12px;text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)'>🏆 Librandi</th><th style='padding:12px;text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)'>🌱 A Vita</th><th style='padding:12px;text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)'>🏺 Ippolito</th><th style='padding:12px;text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)'>🌾 Ceraudo</th><th style='padding:12px;text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)'>👑 Odoardi</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style='background:#fff'><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>🎯 市場定位</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>國際現代派<br>混釀創新</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>自然派先鋒<br>純淨主義</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>傳統經典<br>歷史底蘊</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>有機生動<br>風土表達</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>貴族典雅<br>單一園精品</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8f9fa'><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>🍷 核心風格</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>濃郁強勁<br>國際口感</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>輕盈活潑<br>原始純淨</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>經典平衡<br>傳統優雅</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>中等飽滿<br>生動複雜</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>細膩精緻<br>陳年優雅</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff'><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>💶 價格帶</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center;color:#f39c12;font-weight:700'>€35-50<br>(頂級)</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center;color:#27ae60;font-weight:700'>€22-32<br>(中高)</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center;color:#3498db;font-weight:700'>€28-40<br>(中高)</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center;color:#f39c12;font-weight:700'>€30-45<br>(頂級)</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center;color:#27ae60;font-weight:700'>€25-38<br>(中高)</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8f9fa'><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>⭐ 國際評分</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>Parker 90</strong><br>(Gravello)</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#8e44ad'>WE 91</strong><br>(Rosso)</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#c0392b'>GR 3杯</strong><br>(Liber Pater)</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#27ae60'>Bio認證</strong><br>Demeter</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#3498db'>GR 2杯</strong><br>貴族血統</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff'><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>📅 陳年潛力</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>10-15年</strong><br>Riserva更長</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong>5-8年</strong><br>年輕易飲</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>10-15年</strong><br>經典陳年型</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong>7-12年</strong><br>平衡陳年</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'><strong>8-12年</strong><br>優雅演化</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8f9fa'><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#16a085'>🎫 參訪價值</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>€15<br>⭐⭐⭐⭐</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>€20<br>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐<br>(Alberto接待)</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>€12<br>⭐⭐⭐⭐<br>(含博物館)</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>€25<br>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐<br>(Agriturismo)</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center'>€18<br>⭐⭐⭐⭐<br>(城堡導覽)</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff3cd'><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;font-weight:600;color:#d35400'>💡 推薦族群</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center;font-size:.85rem'>國際酒迷<br>混釀愛好者</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center;font-size:.85rem'>自然派信徒<br>純淨風格控</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center;font-size:.85rem'>歷史愛好者<br>經典主義者</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center;font-size:.85rem'>有機追隨者<br>風土探索家</td><td style='padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd;text-align:center;font-size:.85rem'>貴族浪漫派<br>單一園收藏家</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style='margin-top:25px;padding:25px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fadbd8,#f5b7b1);border-radius:12px;border-left:6px solid #c0392b;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(192,57,43,.2)'><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.9;color:#2c3e50;font-size:1.05rem'><strong style='color:#c0392b;font-size:1.2rem'>🎯 酒莊參訪終極建議：</strong><br><strong style='color:#3498db'>首訪必選：</strong>A Vita(€20) — Alberto本人講解自然派哲學，50%機率遇到莊主，最純粹的Gaglioppo體驗<br><strong style='color:#d4af37'>歷史深度：</strong>Ippolito 1845(€12) — 179年歷史+葡萄酒博物館，性價比最高的歷史之旅<br><strong style='color:#27ae60'>美食體驗：</strong>Ceraudo(€25+€60午餐) — Agriturismo全套體驗，有機料理搭配生物動力葡萄酒<br><strong style='color:#8e44ad'>頂級收藏：</strong>Librandi Gravello(€35-50) — Calabria國際化標竿，Parker 90分混釀，值得陳年10年+<br><strong style='color:#f39c12'>貴族浪漫：</strong>Odoardi(€18) — 16世紀城堡+單一園Vigna Mortilla，歷史與風土的極致結合</p></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍯 Greco di Bianco DOC - 稀有的甜白酒</h2><div class='greco-bianco-section'><div class='greco-intro'><h3>🍯 義大利最古老的甜酒之一</h3><p>Greco di Bianco DOC 產自 Calabria 最南端的<strong>Bianco 小鎮</strong>，是義大利<strong>最稀有、最古老的甜白酒</strong>之一，產量極小。</p></div><div class='greco-details'><div class='detail-card'><h4>🍇 釀造方式</h4><p><strong>品種：</strong>Greco Bianco（100%）</p><p><strong>方法：</strong>葡萄風乾（Appassimento）或晚採收</p><p><strong>風乾時間：</strong>1-2 週</p><p><strong>殘糖：</strong>100-150 g/L</p><p><strong>酒精度：</strong>17%+（極高）</p></div><div class='detail-card'><h4>🍷 風味特徵</h4><p><strong>顏色：</strong>金黃色至琥珀色</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>杏桃乾、蜂蜜、橙花、柑橘皮、焦糖、堅果</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>甜美、濃郁、復雜、陳年潛力 10-20 年</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>義大利最甜、最濃郁的甜白酒之一</p></div><div class='detail-card'><h4>🍽️ 配餐</h4><ul><li>🍰 傳統義式甜點</li><li>🧀 藍紋起司、Gorgonzola</li><li>🥮 堅果塔、杏仁餅</li><li>🍫 黑巧克力</li><li>🍊 柑橘類甜點</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 其他重要 Calabria DOC</h2><div class='other-docs'><div class='doc-card'><h3>Lamezia DOC</h3><div class='doc-info'><p><strong>位置：</strong>Lamezia Terme（Calabria 中部）</p><p><strong>紅酒品種：</strong>Gaglioppo、Magliocco、Greco Nero</p><p><strong>白酒品種：</strong>Greco Bianco、Mantonico</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>紅酒濃郁、果香豐富</p></div></div><div class='doc-card'><h3>Bivongi DOC</h3><div class='doc-info'><p><strong>位置：</strong>Calabria 南部（Ionian 海岸）</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>允許紅、白、Passito 甜酒</p><p><strong>主要品種：</strong>Gaglioppo、Greco Bianco、Mantonico</p></div></div><div class='doc-card'><h3>Savuto DOC</h3><div class='doc-info'><p><strong>位置：</strong>Calabria 西海岸（Tyrrhenian 海）</p><p><strong>品種：</strong>Gaglioppo（主導）+ Magliocco、Sangiovese</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>輕至中等酒體、易飲</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍽️ Calabria 美食與配餐</h2><div class='calabria-cuisine'><div class='cuisine-intro'><h3>🌶️ 辣味海鮮與 'Nduja</h3><p>Calabria 料理以<strong>辣椒、海鮮、劍魚、'Nduja 辣味抹醬香腸</strong>為特色，風格熱情、香料重。</p></div><div class='food-grid'><div class='food-card'><h4>🌶️ 'Nduja</h4><p class='dish-desc'>Calabria 超辣抹醬香腸（可塗麵包）</p><p><strong>成分：</strong>豬肉、辣椒、鹽</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>Cirò Rosso Classico Superiore</li><li>Gaglioppo Riserva</li></ul></div><div class='food-card'><h4>🐟 Pesce Spada（劍魚）</h4><p class='dish-desc'>Calabria 海鮮代表（燒烤或燉煮）</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>Cirò Bianco</li><li>Greco Bianco</li></ul></div><div class='food-card'><h4>🍝 Fileja con 'Nduja</h4><p class='dish-desc'>手工麵條配 'Nduja 辣醬</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>Cirò Rosato（清爽解辣）</li><li>Gaglioppo</li></ul></div><div class='food-card'><h4>🧀 Caciocavallo Silano DOP</h4><p class='dish-desc'>Calabria 傳統拉絲起司</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>Cirò Rosso</li><li>Greco di Bianco（甜酒配陳年起司）</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide' style='background:#f8f9fa'><h2 style='color:#16a085;border-bottom:3px solid #1abc9c;padding-bottom:12px;margin-bottom:30px'>🌶️ SLIDE 6: 'Nduja美食文化 + 配餐指南 + 雙海旅遊攻略</h2><div style='background:#fff;padding:35px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.12)'><div style='margin-bottom:35px'><h3 style='color:#16a085;margin:0 0 25px;font-size:1.4rem;text-align:center'>🌶️ Part A: 'Nduja辣味文化深度解析</h3><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 3fr;gap:30px;margin-bottom:25px'><div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c0392b,#e74c3c);color:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 15px rgba(192,57,43,.4);margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 20px;font-size:1.3rem;border-bottom:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);padding-bottom:10px'>📍 起源與認證</h4><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);padding:20px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:15px'><p style='margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05rem'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>發源地：</strong>Spilinga小鎮<br><span style='font-size:.9rem;opacity:.9'>(Tyrrhenian海岸 Vibo Valentia省)</span></p><p style='margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05rem'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>DOP認證：</strong>2015年獲得<br><span style='font-size:.9rem;opacity:.9'>('Nduja di Spilinga DOP)</span></p><p style='margin:0;line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05rem'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>歷史：</strong>300年+傳統<br><span style='font-size:.9rem;opacity:.9'>(18世紀西班牙影響)</span></p></div><div style='background:rgba(0,0,0,.2);padding:20px;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3)'><div style='font-size:3rem;margin-bottom:10px'>🌡️</div><div style='font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px'>15,000-30,000</div><div style='font-size:1.1rem;opacity:.95'>Scoville辣度單位(SHU)</div><div style='font-size:.85rem;margin-top:10px;opacity:.8'>辣度等級: 中上 (相當於墨西哥Jalapeño的3-6倍)</div></div></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d35400,#e67e22);color:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(211,84,0,.3)'><h4 style='margin:0 0 18px;font-size:1.2rem;border-bottom:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);padding-bottom:8px'>🥩 成分比例</h4><div style='display:grid;gap:15px'><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);padding:18px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #fff'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px'><span style='font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600'>🐷 豬肉部位</span><span style='font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;color:#d4af37'>70%</span></div><div style='background:#ecf0f1;height:15px;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden'><div style='background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff,#e8daef);width:70%;height:100%'></div></div><p style='margin:10px 0 0;font-size:.9rem;opacity:.9'>肥肉為主(頸部、腹部、背部脂肪)</p></div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);padding:18px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #c0392b'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px'><span style='font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600'>🌶️ Calabrian Peperoncino</span><span style='font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;color:#d4af37'>30%</span></div><div style='background:#ecf0f1;height:15px;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden'><div style='background:linear-gradient(90deg,#e74c3c,#c0392b);width:30%;height:100%'></div></div><p style='margin:10px 0 0;font-size:.9rem;opacity:.9'>新鮮or乾燥辣椒(Peperoncino di Calabria)</p></div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);padding:12px 15px;border-radius:6px;text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3)'><p style='margin:0;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.6'>+ 海鹽 + 香料 (月桂、黑胡椒、茴香籽)</p></div></div></div></div><div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16a085,#1abc9c);color:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 15px rgba(22,160,133,.4);margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 20px;font-size:1.3rem;text-align:center;border-bottom:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);padding-bottom:10px'>🍖 'Nduja製作流程圖</h4><div style='display:grid;gap:18px'><div style='position:relative;padding-left:50px'><div style='position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:40px;height:40px;background:#d4af37;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.3)'>1</div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);padding:15px 20px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #d4af37'><h5 style='margin:0 0 8px;font-size:1.05rem'>原料準備</h5><p style='margin:0;font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.7;opacity:.95'>選擇肥瘦比7:3的豬肉部位(頸部、腹部、背脂)，新鮮Calabrian Peperoncino辣椒去籽絞碎</p></div></div><div style='position:relative;padding-left:50px'><div style='position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:40px;height:40px;background:#e67e22;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.3)'>2</div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);padding:15px 20px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #e67e22'><h5 style='margin:0 0 8px;font-size:1.05rem'>手工絞肉</h5><p style='margin:0;font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.7;opacity:.95'>豬肉與辣椒混合，使用傳統石磨or現代絞肉機絞成細緻泥狀(Paste質地)</p></div></div><div style='position:relative;padding-left:50px'><div style='position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:40px;height:40px;background:#c0392b;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.3)'>3</div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);padding:15px 20px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #c0392b'><h5 style='margin:0 0 8px;font-size:1.05rem'>調味混合</h5><p style='margin:0;font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.7;opacity:.95'>加入海鹽(3-4%)、黑胡椒、月桂葉、茴香籽等香料，攪拌均勻至滑順</p></div></div><div style='position:relative;padding-left:50px'><div style='position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:40px;height:40px;background:#8e44ad;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.3)'>4</div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);padding:15px 20px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #8e44ad'><h5 style='margin:0 0 8px;font-size:1.05rem'>灌腸發酵</h5><p style='margin:0;font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.7;opacity:.95'>填入豬腸衣(直徑3-5cm)，懸掛於通風陰涼處自然發酵<strong style='color:#d4af37'>2-12個月</strong></p></div></div><div style='position:relative;padding-left:50px'><div style='position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:40px;height:40px;background:#27ae60;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.3)'>5</div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);padding:15px 20px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #27ae60'><h5 style='margin:0 0 8px;font-size:1.05rem'>熟成完成</h5><p style='margin:0;font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.7;opacity:.95'>質地變為柔軟可塗抹，呈現深紅色澤，散發辣椒與豬肉發酵的複雜香氣</p></div></div></div></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f39c12,#f1c40f);color:#2c3e50;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(243,156,18,.3)'><h4 style='margin:0 0 18px;color:#fff;font-size:1.2rem;text-align:center;border-bottom:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.5);padding-bottom:10px;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.3)'>🍴 現代6大應用場景</h4><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px'><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);padding:12px 15px;border-radius:6px;border-left:4px solid #c0392b'><strong style='color:#c0392b'>🥖 抹麵包：</strong>塗抹Focaccia/烤麵包片</div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);padding:12px 15px;border-radius:6px;border-left:4px solid #e67e22'><strong style='color:#e67e22'>🍝 拌意麵：</strong>Fileja麵條經典搭配</div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);padding:12px 15px;border-radius:6px;border-left:4px solid #d35400'><strong style='color:#d35400'>🍕 Pizza topping：</strong>替代辣椒醬增香</div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);padding:12px 15px;border-radius:6px;border-left:4px solid #8e44ad'><strong style='color:#8e44ad'>🥩 烤肉醬：</strong>塗抹豬排/雞肉烤製</div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);padding:12px 15px;border-radius:6px;border-left:4px solid #16a085'><strong style='color:#16a085'>🧀 起司拼盤：</strong>搭配Ricotta/Mozzarella</div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);padding:12px 15px;border-radius:6px;border-left:4px solid #27ae60'><strong style='color:#27ae60'>🍳 煎蛋配料：</strong>炒蛋/Frittata增辣</div></div></div></div></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:35px'><h3 style='color:#16a085;margin:0 0 25px;font-size:1.4rem;text-align:center'>🍷 Part B: Calabria葡萄酒配餐指南 — 4大經典場景</h3><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px'><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8f8f5,#d1f2eb);padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border-top:5px solid #1abc9c;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.1)'><div style='text-align:center;margin-bottom:15px'><div style='font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:8px'>🌊</div><h4 style='margin:0;color:#16a085;font-size:1.15rem'>場景1: 地中海日常</h4></div><div style='background:#fff;padding:18px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:15px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.08)'><h5 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#1abc9c;font-size:1.05rem;border-bottom:2px solid #d1f2eb;padding-bottom:8px'>🍷 年輕Cirò Rosso</h5><div style='text-align:center;margin-bottom:10px'><span style='font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:#27ae60'>€8-15</span></div><p style='margin:0 0 8px;color:#7f8c8d;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.6'>風格: 果香清新、單寧柔順、易飲型<br>適飲溫度: 14-16°C</p></div><div style='background:rgba(22,160,133,.1);padding:15px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #16a085'><h5 style='margin:0 0 10px;color:#16a085;font-size:1rem'>🍽️ 配餐推薦</h5><ul style='margin:0;padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;font-size:.92rem;color:#2c3e50'><li>Fileja意麵 + 番茄醬</li><li>燒烤魚類(鱸魚/鯛魚)</li><li>新鮮Caciocavallo起司</li><li>地中海蔬菜烤盤</li></ul></div></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fadbd8,#f5b7b1);padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border-top:5px solid #e74c3c;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.1)'><div style='text-align:center;margin-bottom:15px'><div style='font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:8px'>🌶️</div><h4 style='margin:0;color:#c0392b;font-size:1.15rem'>場景2: 'Nduja辣味</h4></div><div style='background:#fff;padding:18px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:15px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.08)'><h5 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#e74c3c;font-size:1.05rem;border-bottom:2px solid #fadbd8;padding-bottom:8px'>🏆 Cirò Classico Superiore</h5><div style='text-align:center;margin-bottom:10px'><span style='font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:#d35400'>€18-35</span></div><p style='margin:0 0 8px;color:#7f8c8d;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.6'>風格: 中至飽滿酒體、單寧成熟、香料複雜<br>適飲溫度: 16-18°C</p></div><div style='background:rgba(192,57,43,.15);padding:15px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #c0392b'><h5 style='margin:0 0 10px;color:#c0392b;font-size:1rem'>🌶️ 辣味配餐</h5><ul style='margin:0;padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;font-size:.92rem;color:#2c3e50'><li>'Nduja抹麵包烤片</li><li>Fileja con 'Nduja經典</li><li>辣味香腸拼盤</li><li>Peperoncino橄欖油pasta</li></ul></div></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d6eaf8,#ebf5fb);padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border-top:5px solid #3498db;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.1)'><div style='text-align:center;margin-bottom:15px'><div style='font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:8px'>🐟</div><h4 style='margin:0;color:#2980b9;font-size:1.15rem'>場景3: 海鮮BBQ</h4></div><div style='background:#fff;padding:18px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:15px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.08)'><h5 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#3498db;font-size:1.05rem;border-bottom:2px solid #d6eaf8;padding-bottom:8px'>👑 Gaglioppo Riserva</h5><div style='text-align:center;margin-bottom:10px'><span style='font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:#8e44ad'>€30-50</span></div><p style='margin:0 0 8px;color:#7f8c8d;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.6'>風格: 飽滿強勁、陳年複雜、皮革煙草<br>適飲溫度: 17-19°C</p></div><div style='background:rgba(52,152,219,.15);padding:15px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #2980b9'><h5 style='margin:0 0 10px;color:#2980b9;font-size:1rem'>🔥 燒烤配餐</h5><ul style='margin:0;padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;font-size:.92rem;color:#2c3e50'><li>烤劍魚(Pesce Spada)</li><li>炭烤章魚 + 檸檬</li><li>雙海海鮮拼盤</li><li>炭烤鮪魚排</li></ul></div></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fef5e7,#fdebd0);padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border-top:5px solid #f39c12;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.1)'><div style='text-align:center;margin-bottom:15px'><div style='font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:8px'>🍯</div><h4 style='margin:0;color:#d35400;font-size:1.15rem'>場景4: 甜點起司</h4></div><div style='background:#fff;padding:18px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:15px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.08)'><h5 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#f39c12;font-size:1.05rem;border-bottom:2px solid #fef5e7;padding-bottom:8px'>✨ Greco di Bianco DOC</h5><div style='text-align:center;margin-bottom:10px'><span style='font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:#c0392b'>€30-60</span></div><p style='margin:0 0 8px;color:#7f8c8d;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.6'>風格: 甜美濃郁、蜂蜜杏桃、高酒精17%+<br>適飲溫度: 10-12°C</p></div><div style='background:rgba(243,156,18,.15);padding:15px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #d35400'><h5 style='margin:0 0 10px;color:#d35400;font-size:1rem'>🍰 甜品配搭</h5><ul style='margin:0;padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;font-size:.92rem;color:#2c3e50'><li>Caciocavallo Silano DOP陳年</li><li>Ricotta起司甜點</li><li>杏仁餅 + 蜂蜜</li><li>乾無花果 + 核桃</li></ul></div></div></div></div><div><h3 style='color:#16a085;margin:0 0 25px;font-size:1.4rem;text-align:center'>🗺️ Part C: 雙海旅遊攻略 — 2條精選路線完整規劃</h3><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:30px'><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3498db,#2980b9);color:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(52,152,