at:right'>免費</strong><br><span style='font-size:.88rem;opacity:.9'>Capo Vaticano觀景點+白色沙灘</span></div><div style='background:rgba(212,175,55,.3);padding:10px 15px;border-radius:6px;text-align:center;margin-top:8px'><strong>20:00住宿:</strong> Pizzo海濱小鎮 <strong style='float:right'>€110/晚</strong><br><span style='font-size:.85rem;opacity:.9'>(含Tartufo冰淇淋甜點€10)</span></div></div></div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:18px;border-left:5px solid #8e44ad'><h5 style='margin:0 0 15px;font-size:1.2rem;border-bottom:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);padding-bottom:8px'>📅 Day 3: 雙海觀景點+返程</h5><div style='display:grid;gap:12px'><div style='background:rgba(0,0,0,.2);padding:12px 15px;border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #27ae60'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>09:00</strong> Sila高原雙海觀景台 <strong style='float:right'>€10</strong><br><span style='font-size:.88rem;opacity:.9'>同時眺望Ionian+Tyrrhenian雙海(停車費)</span></div><div style='background:rgba(0,0,0,.2);padding:12px 15px;border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #16a085'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>12:00</strong> Savuto DOC酒莊午餐 <strong style='float:right'>€45</strong><br><span style='font-size:.88rem;opacity:.9'>Tyrrhenian海岸產區+Savuto品酒</span></div><div style='background:rgba(0,0,0,.2);padding:12px 15px;border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #3498db'><strong style='color:#d4af37'>16:00</strong> Lamezia機場返程 <strong style='float:right'>-</strong><br><span style='font-size:.88rem;opacity:.9'>還車+Check-in(預留2小時)</span></div></div></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c0392b,#a93226);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.3)'><h5 style='margin:0 0 15px;font-size:1.15rem;border-bottom:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4);padding-bottom:10px'>💰 費用總計明細</h5><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:10px;text-align:left'><div>🍷 餐飲+活動</div><div style='text-align:right;font-weight:700'>€180</div><div>🏨 住宿 (2晚)</div><div style='text-align:right;font-weight:700'>€205</div><div>🚗 租車含油費(3天)</div><div style='text-align:right;font-weight:700'>€110</div><div>🎫 其他雜費</div><div style='text-align:right;font-weight:700'>€55</div><div style='border-top:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.5);padding-top:8px;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:#d4af37'>總計</div><div style='border-top:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.5);padding-top:8px;text-align:right;font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;color:#d4af37'>€550</div></div><div style='margin-top:12px;font-size:.9rem;opacity:.9;padding:10px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.2);border-radius:6px'>*預算€800/人含高級住宿+彈性升級</div></div></div></div></div><div style='margin-top:30px;padding:25px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d5f4e6,#a3e4d7);border-radius:12px;border-left:6px solid#16a085;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(22,160,133,.2)'><h4 style='margin:0 0 20px;color:#16a085;font-size:1.25rem;text-align:center;border-bottom:2px solid #16a085;padding-bottom:10px'>✅ 旅行者實用Checklist</h4><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px'><div style='background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.1)'><h5 style='margin:0 0 15px;color:#c0392b;font-size:1.1rem'>🎫 預訂事項</h5><ul style='margin:0;padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;font-size:.92rem;color:#2c3e50'><li>酒莊參訪<strong>提前2週</strong>預約</li><li>Agriturismo午餐<strong>需預訂</strong></li><li>租車預訂(Lamezia機場取還)</li><li>旺季(7-9月)住宿<strong>提早1月</strong></li></ul></div><div style='background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.1)'><h5 style='margin:0 0 15px;color:#f39c12;font-size:1.1rem'>🧳 攜帶清單</h5><ul style='margin:0;padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;font-size:.92rem;color:#2c3e50'><li>防曬霜SPF50+(夏季必備)</li><li>登山鞋(葡萄園徒步)</li><li>泳裝(海岸線路線)</li><li>相機+備用電池</li></ul></div><div style='background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.1)'><h5 style='margin:0 0 15px;color:#3498db;font-size:1.1rem'>📱 實用資訊</h5><ul style='margin:0;padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;font-size:.92rem;color:#2c3e50'><li>最佳季節:<strong>5-6月</strong>或<strong>9-10月</strong></li><li>語言:義大利語(英語通用度低)</li><li>付款:現金+信用卡備用</li><li>Lamezia機場距Cirò<strong>1小時</strong></li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點回顧</h2><div class='key-points'><div class='point'>✓ Calabria 位於義大利「腳尖」，擁有 2500 年葡萄酒歷史</div><div class='point'>✓ Cirò DOC 是 Calabria 最知名產區，傳說是古希臘奧運選手的酒</div><div class='point'>✓ Gaglioppo 是 Calabria 代表紅葡萄品種，被稱為「南義的 Pinot Noir」</div><div class='point'>✓ Greco di Bianco DOC 是義大利最稀有的甜白酒之一，酒精度 17%+</div><div class='point'>✓ Magliocco 是濃郁、顏色深的紅葡萄品種</div><div class='point'>✓ 'Nduja 是 Calabria 超辣抹醬香腸，完美搭配 Cirò Rosso</div></div></section></div><style>.region-intro{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.intro-text{margin-bottom:25px}.intro-text p{font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50;margin:0 0 15px}.highlight{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d1f2eb,#a3e4d7);padding:15px 20px;border-radius:10px;border-left:5px solid #16a085;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}.calabria-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.stat-card{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1abc9c,#16a085);padding:30px 25px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}.stat-icon{font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:12px}.stat-value{font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px}.stat-label{font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5;opacity:.95}.ciro-section{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.ciro-intro{text-align:center;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d6eaf8,#ebf5fb);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:25px}.ciro-intro h3{margin:0 0 12px;color:#3498db;font-size:1.4rem}.ciro-intro p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.ciro-wines{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.wine-type{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,